      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Thanks for the reply,\r\nI'm using DNA sequences and a sentence in the corpus is something like ACCGGTCATCGTCA (a sequence of A C T Gs), and initial tokens (alphabet) are A, C, T, and G. So, I guess no pre-tokenization is needed, and I used BpeTrainer without any pre-tokenization.\r\nDo you suggest any specific pre-tokenizer for my case? a tokenizer to take each character (A,C,T,G) as a token (there is no whitespace or any other characters).\r\n",
