      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "For DNA I think you would need : https://huggingface.co/docs/tokenizers/v0.13.3/en/api/trainers#tokenizers.trainers.BpeTrainer.max_token_length\r\n\r\nHaving this will prevent tokens from being longer than `max_token_length`. This will cap the computation and it should work faster.\r\nHowever you will be unable to have tokens longer than this limit (no idea if there's a \"good\" default for your data)",
