    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nI have trouble training a BPE tokenizer using HuggingFace tokenizers:\r\n\r\n- Corpus: ~13 billions characters (~13 GB)\r\n- Tokenizer: Byte Pair Encoding (BPE)\r\n- Vocabulary Size: 512\r\n\r\nI trained the BPE tokenizer via YouTokenToMe with 8 threads... and it finished in **less than 10 minutes.**\r\nHowever, I'm trying to train the BPE tokenizer using BpeTrainer (`tokenizers.trainers.BpeTrainer`) with 256 threads... and it has not finished yet **after more than 10 hours.**\r\n\r\nWhy?",
    "closed_at": "2023-12-19T01:50:22Z",
    "closed_by": {
